     <target value="2"></target>
     <actual value="0">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Result is 0 
This has not been and will not be executed in 2022 or in the future, for several reasons: 
First of all, we have attempted to capture fair value distribution in the legal structure of one social enterprise through a co-ownership model, where workers would own shares of the company. Besides the complexity of the set-up, the social enterprise was not profiting financially yet and there was no clarity on financial profits in the near term, making it unfavorable for workers to capture that risk. Therefore, we have put this idea on hold, to potentially pick up in the future if we see potential for increased fair value distribution. 
Second, there has been a period of understaffing in the Accelerate pillar, which has been resolved with a new colleague being incorporated in the project. However, the graduation strategy had been included in the annual plan based on past experience and skills of previous staffing. Given that the graduation strategy seems less aligned with the rest of the plans within the RS! Accelerate pillar, and the delay in execution of the graduation strategy due to the period of understaffing, we consider it more beneficial to focus our resources on accelerating disruptive innovations on the basis of existing pilots with TRACE and ALIGN and other corporate strategies to increase fair value distribution.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
